   6:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following
   7:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          functionalities of the Timer (TIM) peripheral:
