  14:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Output Compare/PWM  Start
  15:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Output Compare/PWM  Start Interruption
  16:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Output Compare/PWM Start DMA
