  18:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Input Capture Channel Configuration
  19:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Input Capture Start
  20:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Input Capture Start Interruption
  21:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM Input Capture Start DMA
  22:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM One Pulse Initialization
  23:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM One Pulse Channel Configuration
  24:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *           + TIM One Pulse Start
