2634:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         requires a timer reset to avoid unexpected direction
2635:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         due to DIR bit readonly in center aligned mode.
