2638:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         channels 1 and channel 2 are reserved and cannot be used for other
2639:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *         purpose.
2640:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  htim TIM One Pulse handle
2641:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  OnePulseMode Select the One pulse mode.
