2643:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_SINGLE: Only one pulse will be generated.
2644:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_OPMODE_REPETITIVE: Repetitive pulses will be generated.
