7555:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   * @param  TIM_ICSelection specifies the input to be used.
7556:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *          This parameter can be one of the following values:
7557:Inc/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_tim.c ****   *            @arg TIM_ICSELECTION_DIRECTTI: TIM Input 1 is selected to be connected to IC1.
